        307.9,
        153.3,
        307.9
      ],
      "text": "2.\nShri Rajiv Gandhi has been sworn-in as the Prime\nMinister by the President at 5-15 P.M. today, 31st December,\n1984, in the Rashtrapati Bhavan. Other Ministers sworn-in\nby the President at 5-15 P.M. today, the 31st December, 1984\nare shown at Annexure 'B'."
